iors is the child's list verbatim; divergent_probe_indices and per_probe are computed mechanically from the comparison. The root performs no substantive spec analysis.\",\n  \"final_deliverable_shape_ref\": \"package/task.json -> deliverable\",\n  \"child_deliverable_expected\": [\"clean_impl.py\", \"child-result.json\"],\n  \"self_check_outcome\": \"PASS (non-authoritative): child-contract attenuates against both K-E5-trial and K-E5-child-max on every axis; child-harness is the required linear observe->hypothesize->verify->return chain and compiles under the child contract; input manifest contains only available_artifacts and honors the reference.py clean-room exclusion; integration-plan is deterministic and executable; every assigned distinction_id references a listed unresolved distinction; child-prompt leaks no reference-derived analysis. Kernel validation governs.\",\n  \"notes\": \"Parent session ends after this return node. Realization of the validated child is performed by the deterministic root harness; no complete event is emitted by this session.\"\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":728,"cache_read_input_tokens":65664,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":728},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5a222cd0-28e5-4997-9e99-e0e64f46083a","uuid":"a2dd51da-46f6-4391-bd98-29e82d692960","timestamp":"2026-08-09T13:58:14.777Z","request_id":"req_011CdsHtmX4mHdDQcZTwTuiR"}
